# Tank turret, blue (ticket 29.6): the duck tank's head in team blue on a short neck, turning on the body's back; the beak (the barrel) is on
# its front, and the scouts' floating eyes hover over the head, looking where the beak points.
# Pivot: the origin is the neck's bottom on the head's axis (it turns about y); in tank-bathroom-blue-body it is at (0, 0.3, 0). The
# barrel's (tank-bathroom-blue-barrel) pivot is at (0, 0.05, 0.13) in this model, in the head's front.
format 1
collider convex

Detail detail=0.32
    Union
        Material material=machine_blue_rubber
            SmoothUnion smoothness=0.04
                Translate translation=(0, 0.03, 0)
                    CappedCylinder radius=0.1 height=0.05
                Translate translation=(0, 0.13, 0.05)
                    Sphere radius=0.115
        # Eyes, mirrored: the scouts' eyeballs at a little over half size, floating over the head's front, as eye_machine,
        # the scouts' eye meshed coarser (content/parts/machines)
        SymmetryX
            Translate translation=(0.08, 0.3, 0.1)
                Scale scale=(0.55, 0.55, 0.55)
                    Part part=eye_machine
